*> COBOL 2014 OPTIONS paragraph: a default rounding mode for the program.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. OPTIONSPARA.
OPTIONS.
    DEFAULT ROUNDED MODE IS NEAREST-EVEN.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 X PIC S9V99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    COMPUTE X ROUNDED = 2.345
    DISPLAY "rounded 2.345 under default nearest-even=" X
    STOP RUN.
